              "text": "58",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuri duúx tsee/aá i alé gixsaro, kuri tlaquút ar tlaa/e. Nee lamabu'uuse inqwaruuín guri qás dír ya'aá garmaako ta bay Saulo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.58",
            "verseOrgIds": [
